.TH "whipper" "1" "2020" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
whipper \- A CD ripping utility focusing on accuracy over speed
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
whipper [\fBsubcommand\fP]
whipper [\fB\-R\fP] [\fB\-v\fP] [\fB\-h\fP] [\fB\-e\fP \fI{never failure success always}\fP]
.fi
.sp
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.nf
\fBwhipper\fP is a CD ripping utility focusing on accuracy over speed that
supports multiple features. As such, \fBwhipper\fP:
.fi
.sp
.nf

.fi
.sp
.nf
* Detects correct read offset (in samples)
* Detects whether ripped media is a CD\-R
* Has ability to defeat cache of drives
* Performs Test & Copy rips
* Verifies rip accuracy using the AccurateRip database
* Uses MusicBrainz for metadata lookup
* Supports reading the pre\-emphasis flag embedded into some CDs (and
.in +2
correctly tags the resulting rip)
.in -2
* Detects and rips non digitally silent Hidden Track One Audio (HTOA)
* Provides batch ripping capabilities
* Provides templates for file and directory naming
* Supports lossless encoding of ripped audio tracks (FLAC)
* Allows extensibility through external logger plugins
.fi
.sp
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.nf
\fB\-h\fP | \fB\-\-help\fP
.in +2
Show this help message and exit
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.nf
\fB\-e\fP | \fB\-\-eject\fP  \fInever failure success always\fP
.in +2
When to eject disc (default: success)
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.nf
\fB\-c\fP | \fB\-\-drive\-auto\-close\fP \fITrue False\fP
.in +2
Whether to auto close the drive\(aqs tray before reading a CD
(default: True)
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.nf
\fB\-R\fP | \fB\-\-record\fP
.in +2
Record API requests for playback
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.nf
\fB\-v\fP | \fB\-\-version\fP
.in +2
Show version information
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.SH Subcommands
.sp
\fBwhipper\fP gives you a tree of subcommands to work with, namely:
.nf

.fi
.sp
.nf
* accurip
* cd
* drive
* image
* mblookup
* offset
.fi
.sp
.nf
For more details on these subcommands, see their respective man pages.
.fi
.sp
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.nf
Bugs can be reported to your distribution\(aqs bug tracker or upstream
at \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:whipper-team/\:whipper/\:issues>\&.
.fi
.sp
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
whipper\-accurip(1), whipper\-cd(1), whipper\-drive(1), whipper\-image(1),
whipper\-mblookup(1), whipper\-offset(1)
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Louis-Philippe Véronneau
